Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.80,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}If you dream about\Npeople who have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:03.02,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}already passed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:04.04,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}It matters how they\Nappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:07.82,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}In my tradition,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:09.86,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}we do not say the dead\Ncome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:10.66,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}to visit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.62,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}We say the part of you\Nthat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:14.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}still loves them comes\Nto visit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:16.50,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}So the question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:18.38,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}never was it really\Nthem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:22.02,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}The question is how they\Nappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:25.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}Think back to last night\Nor to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:26.08,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:27.52,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}Do not force it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}The image comes on its\Nown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:32.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}If they were silent and\Nsimply present,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:33.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}saying nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:35.12,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}nothing is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.32,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}That is memory settling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:38.42,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}longing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:40.46,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}taking a shape you can\Nhold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:43.56,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}If they spoke to you and\Nyou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:44.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}cannot remember the\Nwords,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:47.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}you already know what\Nthey would have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.24,0:00:47.58,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.18,0:00:49.90,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}You are not ready to say\Ngoodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:50.26,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:52.74,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}If they appeared young\Nagain,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:53.68,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}healthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}before the illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}that is you letting go\Nof the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:58.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}last image,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:00:59.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1056)}the hardest one.
